  },
  {
    href: BOFU_INTERNAL_LINKS.nriStudents,
    title: 'Career Counselling for NRI Students',
    description: 'Useful if a Gulf or Portugal-EU emigration decision is already the main question, wherever you are searching from.',
  },
  {
    href: BOFU_ASSESSMENT_LINKS.hub,
    title: 'Free Career Assessments',
    description: 'Free career and skill assessments can be a lower-pressure check if you are not ready for stronger guidance yet.',
  },
];

const faqItems = [
  {
    question: 'Is career counselling in Goa mostly about deciding whether to work the tourist season or leave for a bigger city?',
    answer:
      "For a real share of people searching from Goa, yes, that tension is genuinely central - the gap between a strong October-to-March season and a much thinner corporate job market pushes many toward Mumbai, Bangalore, Pune, or the Gulf. But the service covers the full decision: a hospitality or event-management career built inside Goa, a role in the Verna IT-SEZ or pharma belt, a mainland move, a Gulf contract, or a Portuguese-EU pathway for families who are eligible for it. The right starting point depends on which of those is actually pressing for you.",
  },
  {
    question: "Should I build a career inside Goa's tourism and hospitality economy, or aim for Mumbai, Bangalore, or Pune instead?",
    answer:
      "There is no single right answer - it depends on your specific skills, finances, and goals, not on which option feels more expected. Hotel and resort management, event management, and water-sports operations are genuine, buildable careers in Goa if the seasonality is planned for directly. A mainland move can offer a more structured, year-round income, at the real cost of distance from family and a higher cost of living. Honest counselling should compare both against your actual situation.",
  },
  {
    question: 'My family is eligible for a Portuguese passport through ancestry - does that mean I should apply and move to the EU?',
    answer:
      "Not automatically. Eligibility, tied to Goa's pre-1961 Portuguese-era records held by some families here, is a genuine option worth taking seriously - but it comes with a real application timeline and a language or requalification hurdle for a skilled role once you are actually in Portugal or elsewhere in the EU. Whether it is the right move depends on your field and goals, not on the fact that the option exists in your family.",
  },
  {
    question: 'Is a Gulf hospitality or marine-engineering contract a genuine career option, or just a stopgap between Goa seasons?',
    answer:
      "For many people, it is a genuine, deliberate career track, not a stopgap. Goa's deep hospitality-training base and its long-standing local presence in cruise-ship and marine-engineering roles give real, skills-based access to Gulf and cruise-line employers, often at meaningfully higher and steadier pay than a purely seasonal Goa wage.",
  },
  {
    question: "Is Goa's IT-SEZ and pharma base around Verna a real alternative to leaving the state?",
    answer:
      "Yes, on its own smaller scale. The Verna Industrial Estate and nearby Corlim host a genuine IT-SEZ layer and pharmaceutical-manufacturing plants run by companies including Sun Pharmaceutical Industries and Cipla, creating real quality-control, process-engineering, and plant-operations career tracks. It is a smaller, more specific economy than Bangalore's or Pune's, and it is worth evaluating honestly rather than being overlooked.",
  },
  {
    question: 'Should I aim for a government job in Panaji since Goa is a small state?',
    answer:
      "It can be a strong, secure option, but the seat count is genuinely small relative to how many graduates compete for it each cycle across such a small state. The stronger approach is comparing a government path honestly against a private-sector, tourism-industry, or skill-based route rather than assuming it is automatically the safest choice.",
  },
  {
    question: 'Are the career and skill assessments free?',
    answer: 'Yes. The career and skill assessments are fully free, updated, practical, and AI-powered.',
  },
  {
    question: 'Can this help students, freshers, and working professionals across Panaji, Margao, Vasco da Gama, and the rest of Goa?',
    answer:
      'Yes. Future Career School serves students, freshers, and working professionals across school, college, recent-graduate, postgraduate, and career-growth stages. The guidance is online across India, so it works whether you live in Panaji, Margao, Vasco da Gama, the Calangute-Baga tourist belt, the Verna industrial corridor, or anywhere else in Goa, or are weighing a move away from the state entirely.',
  },
];

const faqJsonLd = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'FAQPage',
  mainEntity: faqItems.map((item) => ({
    '@type': 'Question',
    name: item.question,
    acceptedAnswer: {
      '@type': 'Answer',
      text: item.answer,
    },
  })),
};

const jsonLd = [
  {
    '@context': 'https://schema.org',
    '@type': 'BreadcrumbList',
    itemListElement: [
      { '@type': 'ListItem', position: 1, name: 'Home', item: 'https://futurecareerschool.com/' },
      { '@type': 'ListItem', position: 2, name: 'Services', item: 'https://futurecareerschool.com/services/' },
      {
        '@type': 'ListItem',
        position: 3,
        name: 'Career Counselling and Career Guidance',
        item: 'https://futurecareerschool.com/services/career-counselling-and-career-guidance/',
      },
      {
        '@type': 'ListItem',
        position: 4,
        name: 'Locations',
        item: 'https://futurecareerschool.com/services/career-counselling-and-career-guidance/locations/',
      },
      { '@type': 'ListItem', position: 5, name: 'Career Counselling in Goa', item: canonical },
    ],
  },
  {
    '@context': 'https://schema.org',
    '@type': 'Service',
    name: 'Career Counselling in Goa | Future Career School',
    description:
      'Career counselling in Goa for students, freshers, and working professionals. Online guidance for clearer decisions between a tourism-season income, a move to Mumbai, Bangalore, or Pune, a Gulf hospitality or engineering contract, and a Portuguese-EU pathway for eligible families.',
    url: canonical,
    serviceType: 'Career Counselling and Career Guidance',
    areaServed: [
      { '@type': 'City', name: 'Panaji' },
      { '@type': 'City', name: 'Margao' },
      { '@type': 'City', name: 'Vasco da Gama' },
      { '@type': 'Country', name: 'India' },
    ],
    inLanguage: 'en-IN',
    provider: {
      '@type': ['Organization', 'ProfessionalService'],
      name: 'Future Career School',
      url: 'https://futurecareerschool.com',
    },
  },
  faqJsonLd,
];
---

<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} canonical={canonical} jsonLd={jsonLd}>
  <Nav activePage="career-guidance" />

  <section id="hero">
    <div class="hero-bg">
      <div class="orb orb-gold"></div>
      <div class="orb orb-teal"></div>
      <div class="grid"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="container hero-inner">
      <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
        <a href="/">Home</a>
        <span aria-hidden="true">&rsaquo;</span>
        <a href="/services">Services</a>
        <span aria-hidden="true">&rsaquo;</span>
        <a href="/services/career-counselling-and-career-guidance">Career Counselling and Guidance</a>
        <span aria-hidden="true">&rsaquo;</span>
        <a href={BOFU_INTERNAL_LINKS.guidanceLocations}>Locations</a>
        <span aria-hidden="true">&rsaquo;</span>
        <span aria-current="page">Career Counselling in Goa</span>
      </nav>

      <div class="pill hero-pill">
        <span class="pill-dot"></span>
        Practical support for students, freshers, and working professionals in Panaji, Margao, and across Goa
      </div>

      <h1 class="hero-title">
        Career Counselling in <span class="gold-text">Goa</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="hero-sub">
        Goa's economy runs on two very different clocks: a tourism and hospitality season that fills hotels, resorts, restaurants, and water-sports operations from roughly October through March and thins out considerably once the monsoon sets in, and a much thinner white-collar, corporate job market that pushes a real share of the state's own graduates toward Mumbai, Bangalore, Pune, or the Gulf for stable, year-round income. Between those two realities sits a question few people examine directly: whether a deliberate high-value skill portfolio - built inside Goa's hospitality and tourism economy, inside its smaller but genuine IT-SEZ and pharmaceutical-manufacturing base, or aimed at a stronger opportunity elsewhere - can unlock high income opportunities and move you toward earlier financial freedom faster than whichever path feels expected.
      </p>
      <p class="hero-sub hero-sub-secondary">
        Guidance is delivered fully online across Panaji, Margao, Vasco da Gama, Mapusa, and the rest of Goa, and across India - so you can start from a home near the Calangute-Baga tourist belt, a hostel near BITS Pilani's Goa campus in Zuarinagar, or a family already weighing a Gulf contract or a Portuguese passport application, without adding another commute to an already crowded season.
      </p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a href="#plans" class="btn-gold pulse">Get Student Career Counselling</a>
        <a href="#plans" class="btn-outline">Get Working Professional Career Counselling</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <BofuListCardSection
    sectionId="intent-clarity"
    title="Why this decision already feels heavier here"
